    "notes": "Remove the deal ENTITY but KEEP the kanban view, retargeted onto leads (stage lives on the lead). Tag removal initially declined by mis-click; user corrected to YES remove tags (TASK-016)."
  },
  "out_of_scope": [
    "Bot writing directly to Supabase (would kill the sync; the Sheet dies in a later phase)",
    "Fixing the corrupt asesor_asignado bug (fixed in Phase A)",
    "SLAs / CRM-originated notifications",
    "Analytics dashboards (post-validation)"
  ],
